 "descriptions": {
  "Jews in the South with Beri Schwitzer": "Southern Jewish history: origin stories and immigration, the Civil War and influential Jewish Southerners, assimilation, and civil rights. Thursdays at 1 PM.",
  "Trip to Downtown McKinney": "Enjoy historic downtown McKinney: boutiques, local shops, and restaurants. $15 includes transportation; lunch and shopping on your own. Contact Sharon or Val to sign up.",
  "Arboretum Trip": "Fall at the Dallas Arboretum. Pumpkin Village theme: Harvest Hues through the lens of Basquiat, Rothko, Bourgeois, Mondrian, Escher, and Pollock. 1:15 to 4:30/5 PM. Bring or buy lunch. $30 for entry and transportation. Contact Sharon or Val to sign up.",
  "Lunch": "Hot kosher meals for all ages 60+, JCC membership not required. Suggested donation $4.",
  "Silver Fit": "Strength training using light hand weights.",
  "NIA": "Dance fitness for mind, body, and soul.",
  "Line Dancing": "Learn new and classic line dances. All levels welcome.",
  "Exercise with Ernesto": "Strong heart, strong muscles, big smiles. Chair cardio and strength at its best.",
  "Balance Fitness": "Improve strength and balance and prevent falls. Now in the dance studio.",
  "Chair Yoga": "Increase flexibility and body awareness.",
  "Strength and Stretch": "Strength and cardio using light hand weights and resistance bands."
 },
